cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Glasspad, please cite it as below."
title: "Glasspad"
abstract: "Glasspad is a free, open source (MIT) app that turns an iPhone into a trackpad, keyboard, media remote and button deck for a Mac. An iPhone app and a Mac menu bar app talk over the local Wi-Fi network, paired by QR code and encrypted, with no account and no cloud."
type: software
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-17
license: MIT
